```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client
    participant GW as Vault Gateway (Coordinator)
    participant Meta as SQLite Metadata
    participant N1 as Storage Node 1
    participant N2 as Storage Node 2
    participant N3 as Storage Node 3

    Note over Client, GW: 1. Put Object Flow (Write Quorum W=2, N=3)
    Client->>GW: PUT /objects/:key (Binary Body)
    GW->>GW: Compute SHA-256 Checksum
    GW->>Meta: Create Object (PENDING, v1)
    GW->>GW: PlacementService: Select [N1, N2, N3]
    
    par Write Replicas in Parallel
        GW->>N1: PUT /store/:id (data, checksum)
        GW->>N2: PUT /store/:id (data, checksum)
        GW->>N3: PUT /store/:id (data, checksum)
    end
    
    N1-->>GW: 200 OK (Ack 1)
    N2-->>GW: 200 OK (Ack 2)
    Note over GW: Quorum Achieved (2/3 Acks >= W=2)
    
    GW->>Meta: Commit Object (State: DURABLE)
    GW-->>Client: 201 Created (object_id, checksum, version)
    
    N3-->>GW: 200 OK (Ack 3 - arrives later, recorded)
```
